  "title": "The HuggingFace Agents Course",
  "date": "2026-10-24T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "The HuggingFace Agents Course\n\nThis is a fundamental agent course from huggingface.\nIt can be regard as a supplement of the AI course I learnt this June. As the agent part of that course was too shallow.\n\nWhile I am traveling in Finland. I made the course into a pdf to read.\n\nFor me the introduction part is too easy. The framework part is quite interesting. It compared smolagents, LlamaIndex and LangGraph. And how to evaluate them.\n\nThe bonus units are also a good to read.\n\nThe quiz 1, quiz 2 can be used for checking if you understand AI Agents enough.\n\nThe tool part, there is a very good implementation of a tool use interface.\n\nThe smolagents implementation is a very simple one. Then use the smolagent to build code agent. RAG Systems, although I like the RAG unit more. Multi-Agents and Vision Agents.\n\nThe LlamaIndex part, need to know how to call tooling. Creating agents workflow.\n\nFor langgraph, create the nodes is a must to read, and how to analyse it.",
